summary: Provision a FreeIPA env and run its job recipe
description: |
    Runs on a Testing Farm guest. Builds the channel image from an SRPM
    when one is supplied, then drives the same freeipa-env up/run/down flow
    a local or ssh queue job would. Exits with the run step's status.
test: bash $TMT_TREE/ci/tmt/tests/freeipa-env/tf-runner.sh
duration: 2h
